      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Installera iTAK från App Store",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/fi/app/tak-tracker/id6455684671\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://apps.apple.com/fi/app/tak-tracker/id6455684671</a></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Öppna TAK Tracker-appen",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Hitta ikonen för TAK Tracker och starta appen. Tillåt inte appen att hitta andra enheter i det lokala nätverket. TAK Tracker krypterar inte trafik i ett LAN.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/228e60492645f7cd.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Platsbehörigheter",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tryck på knappen <em>Set Location Permissions</em></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/7b4ff26a8d55ecec.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Tillåt platsspårning",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Välj <em>Allow While Using App</em></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/cfd721cf5ce2840e.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Platsspårning i bakgrunden",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tryck på knappen <em>Enable Backround Tracking</em></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/9948ec9068033f7f.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Tillåt platsspårning i bakgrunden",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Välj <em>Change to Always Allow</em></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/0579fc1b2618966a.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Användarinformation",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tryck på knappen <em>Next</em></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/023bc46cbd628fbd.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Konfiguration av användarinformation",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Konfigurera: anropssignal (Call Sign) och lagfärg enligt den information du har fått</li>\n<li>Standardvärdet för roll (Role) är Team Member</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/cf67eff580a7e99d.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Serveranslutning",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Välj <em>Connect to a TAK Server</em></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/7939f4638beba1b5.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Metod för serveranslutning",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tryck på knappen * Upload a Data Package*</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/e91c43e7b18aa10a.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Konfigurationsfil",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Navigera till mappen där du laddade ner konfigurationsfilen.</li>\n<li>Välj filen du laddade ner från Deployment App</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/bc5a9cba27296c32.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Paketet behandlat",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tryck på knapparna <em>OK</em> och <em>Next</em></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/cc2ec5c824824f38.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Onboarding klar",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tryck på knappen <em>Close Onboarding</em></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/97889f5563eaff15.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "TAK Tracker ansluten",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>TAK Tracker är nu ansluten till en server!</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/20d85d72cf0aeff8.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Konfiguration av enheter",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Du kan konfigurera värdeenheter genom att klicka på ett värde-\"fönster\"</li>\n<li>Ändra platsenhet till MGRS och hastighetsenhet till km/h</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/2ce8beccf72ff98f.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "TAK Tracker konfigurerad",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>TAK Tracker är nu konfigurerad</li>\n<li>Om en karta behövs kan den aktiveras från inställningarna</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Inställningar",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Navigera till inställningarna (kugghjulsikonen)</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/72a6d18a3ba0b580.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Konfiguration av inställningar",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Navigera till Situational Awareness</li>\n<li>Användarinformation kan också ändras från denna vy.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/066154e86975a24a.webp",
              "width": 1179,
              "height": 2556
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Situational Awareness",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Aktivera kartvisning</li>\n<li>Välj den karttyp du vill använda.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
